I doubt it counts as efficient, or even sane (especially for 
non-chaotics), but here's a method I've not seen mentioned:
You need Stormbringer, a ring of gain constitution and a source of monsters.
Your constitution must be such that wearing the ring will push you into 
a higher band of HP gaining on levelup. According to hppw-343.txt, the 
boundaries are at 3/4, 6/7, 14/15, 16/17, 17/18, and 18/19.
Step 1: Throw Stormbringer at yourself.
Step 2: Wear the ring.
Step 3: Kill a monster.
Step 4: Remove the ring.
Repeat.  Each time through should gain you a hitpoint. (For low-level 
characters, there will be randomness here)

I've tested it in wizard mode, and it seems to work, although it is 
tedious and if you get things wrong and throw Stormy at yourself twice 
in a row you won't be happy.

